+
+*Inert* means the value neither changes observable runtime behaviour nor affects the security posture of accepted input — for example, a display-only default or UI-only layout config. A value that cannot be classified as inert from the text is treated as runtime-affecting. Behavioural evidence is evidence that observes the changed behaviour; parsing or shape validation alone does not satisfy it.
 
