+
+**Scale/Scope**: Exactly two modified files at the repository root / under `docs/process/`: `AGENTS.md` and `docs/process/DELIVERY.md`; each change is a table-row wording edit plus a short adjacent paragraph
+
+## Constitution Check
+
+*GATE: Must pass before Phase 0 research. Re-check after Phase 1 design.*
+
+**Governance reference substitution (recorded)**: this checkout has no constitution file at
+`/memory/constitution.md`; per the task brief, the repository root `AGENTS.md` is used as the
