+docs/process/DELIVERY.md           # section 2 "Keel card" — table at lines 23–28
+specs/001-bench/contracts/table-contract.md   # normative target wording (the "interface" of this feature)
+specs/001-bench/quickstart.md      # the observer: scenarios A–E
