+- Row 3 (**new**, sits between the bounded-code-change row and the new-public-surface row): *The change* = "A change to a runtime-affecting or security-affecting config value (for example, a Runtime timeout or a permission setting) — even if the diff is one line"; *route* = "A full card, and behavioural evidence that observes the changed behaviour; parsing or shape validation alone does not count".
