+- Constraint on new prose: no unqualified "config values" anywhere on the light row (FR-001); all prose in English (FR-C4 / AGENTS.md language rule); pre-existing per-file right-column asymmetries ("summary" vs "task record", "(above)" qualifier, "a module" vs "a new module") stay untouched.
+
+---
+
+## Phase 1: Setup (Shared Infrastructure)
+
+**Purpose**: Confirm the delivery surface before editing anything (docs-only feature — no project initialization exists to create).
+
+- [X] T001 Record the verbatim baseline of the proportionality table (rows incl. light row at line ~141 and the sentence following it) in the working notes, and confirm no constitution file exists at `/memory/constitution.md` (governance reference = repo-root `AGENTS.md`, substitution already recorded in specs/001-bench/plan.md) — working directory: repository root
+- [X] T002 [P] Record the verbatim baseline of `docs/process/DELIVERY.md` section 2 ("Keel card", table at lines 23–28), and confirm `extensions/builtin/graphhelm-development-contracts/policies/keel.yaml` exists with version `1.1.0` and rule ids `keel.card.*`, `keel.surface.*`, `keel.body.oversized_change`, `keel.ladder` only (N2 pre-state) — file: docs/process/DELIVERY.md
